@startuml self-improving-loop
!include _standard-style.puml

title The Self-Improving Loop

top to bottom direction

component "Retrieval returns\nranked memory" as R1 <<output>>
component "Agent + human use it" as U1 <<human>>
component "Human reorders\nwhat was useful" as F1 <<human>>
component "Event stored in\nhuman_rerank_feedback" as S1 <<store>>
component "Next similar query\nreranked by learned signal" as R2 <<rerank>>

R1 --> U1
U1 --> F1
F1 DATA_LINE S1
S1 --> R2
R2 SYNC_LINE U1 : feeds back

@enduml
